WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
As for the boredom last night

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,450
It must be menstruation coming

3
00:00:03,450 --> 00:00:05,450
Feeling unwell makes me think wildly

4
00:00:05,450 --> 00:00:14,020
I don’t know when the snow will stop.

5
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,420
Lianyinhe

6
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:17,830
I won't give up these days

7
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:19,030
I heard Afu say

8
00:00:19,030 --> 00:00:20,630
If this snow continues

9
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:22,430
I'm afraid it won't be easy to communicate with the public.

10
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:27,460
I wonder if Xiaoshu needs a helping hand to deal with it. No, Ayu

11
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:30,080
Actually, that's fine among them

12
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:35,880
I want to go home today

13
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:36,880
It's still snowing

14
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:37,880
The road is difficult to navigate

15
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,480
You might as well wait until the snow stops before going back

16
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,080
I've been swept away and now I'm pregnant

17
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,080
It's cold today

18
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,080
I'm a little worried

19
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:46,200
I have to go back and take a look to feel at ease.

20
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:48,200
Then my predecessor will prepare a car to escort you back.

21
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,200
Be more prudent
